Copyright (c) MeddlingIdiot. All rights reserved.

It is not licensed for use, copying, modification or redistribution by anyone else. It ships
inside the MeddlingIdiot.Fallout.Components package only so that MeddlingIdiot's own
installers can show it, and the build only applies it to installers published to
MeddlingIdiot's own storage account. If you use this package for your own applications, set
VelopackSplashImagePath to your own image, or leave it unset to keep Velopack's default.
